  "description": {
   "en": "Seriu meets Yae, an older woman in the photography club, who is something of a celebrity at her university for her free-spirited speech and behavior, especially her magnificent travels from man to man! What's intriguing, though, is their relationship. Frustrated and formerly part of the tennis club, Seriu thinks that his girlfriend has a bit too much baggage, but he unexpectedly gets off to a good start with her! Even though they hurt each other with their honest confessions, they grow with each other. Yasashii Watashi is a whirlwind love story that passionately depicts genuine human relationships."
  },
